022015Z-lambda-core-getnetworkconnector-response-omits-statereason-and-serializes.md","st":"f","sev":"H","ck":"wire","t":"lambda-core GetNetworkConnector response omits StateReason and serializes LastModified as an epoch number"},{"f":"20261023T022015Z-lambda-core-admits-requests-aws-refuses-and-misclassifies.md","st":"o","sev":"H","ck":"wire","t":"lambda-core admits requests AWS refuses and misclassifies identifier refusals across create, update and get"}]}